	(text "A11d (25.10.2026): K1 Mac 3.5\" port J23 = Apple internal 20-pin floppy pinout (tashnotes connector document): 1/3/5/7 GND, 2 CA0, 4 CA1, 6 CA2, 8 LSTRB (= Disk II phases AP_PH0-3), 10 !WRREQ (gated by LOCK), 12 SEL (U27 <- PB0), 14 !ENBL (AP_EN2, J15 removed), 16 RD (AP_RDDATA, U17), 18 WR (AP_WRDATA), 11 +5V, 13/15/17/19 +12V. Pin 9: -12 V only through JP6 (open; 800K/FDHD drives output !EJECT there). Pin 20: PWM (U27 <- PA8 TIM1_CH1) only through JP5 (open; 800K/FDHD output !CSTOUT there), the line always feeds U26 pin 9 -> PB1 so the firmware reads !CSTOUT (R166 10k pull-up). D31 ESD on SEL and pin 20. Cable to the owner's DB19 enclosure socket; no D-sub on the board (owner 24.10.).\nS5: JP8 (bridged) between U18 ICL7662 (12 V to -12 V charge pump, up to 20 V input - not a 7660) and J14 pin 9; no fuse, the pump limits to about 20 mA. S7 is on the Power sheet (J1 shield 1M || 4.7nF). M5/S1-S4/S6 see U26 above (part 1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 370 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
